**POST /api/v1/memos**

Defined in `proto/api/v1/memo_service.proto` (lines 21–25) via the `google.api.http` annotation on the `CreateMemo` RPC:

```protobuf
rpc CreateMemo(CreateMemoRequest) returns (Memo) {
  option (google.api.http) = {
    post: "/api/v1/memos"
    body: "memo"
  };
}
```
